# tally 2.2.1, P24, P48: the residual ledger's head prints the span with each bound variable's value (review g3 res/r1). Before W12: residuals konto m.
=== r1.tally
model r1
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind buys: transfers
kind owners
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place sav: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
place unexplained: outside lives 1900-01-01..
index qs = month 2026-01..2026-12 by 3
input bank: observed
input pay: money PLN
input dn: int
input dd: date
move rent[m in months]: transfers
  on day_of(m, dn)
  leg cash from konto to world amount pay
version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  pay = 100.00 PLN "c"
  dn = 5 "c"
  dd = 2026-03-01 "c"
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "c"
  opening[sav] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "c"
version st
  cite s
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-04-10
  covers konto
  bank[r1] = (on: 2026-03-06, kind: transfers, leg cash from konto to world amount 100.00 PLN, fulfils: rent[2026-03]) "r1"
  bank[r2] = (on: 2026-03-20, kind: buys, leg cash from konto to world amount 5.00 PLN) "r2"
ask a1: residuals konto m for m in [2026-03, 2026-04]
ask a2: residuals konto m .. end_of(m) for m in [2026-03]
ask a3: residuals konto start_of(m) .. start_of(m + 1) for m in [2026-03]
ask a4: residuals konto q for q in qs where start_of(q) == start_of(2026)
ask a5: residuals konto y for y in years
ask a6: residuals p 2026-03 for p in accounts on 2026-03-01
ask a8: residuals konto d .. d + 1 day for d in [2026-03-01, 2026-03-15]
ask a9: residuals konto dd .. day for day in [2026-03-31]
ask a10: residuals konto day .. day + 1 day for day in [2026-03-20]
ask a11: residuals konto 2026-03
ask a12: residuals konto dd .. end_of(dd)
ask a13: residuals konto m .. for m in [2026-03]
ask a14: residuals konto .. end_of(m) for m in [2026-03]
=== expect a1 a4 a5 a11
a1 (m = 2026-03): residuals konto 2026-03
  2026-03 unexplained: model 0.00 PLN, observed -5.00 PLN, difference -5.00 PLN
    unexplained bank[r2] on 2026-03-20: observed -5.00 PLN
  2026-03 move rent: model -100.00 PLN, observed -100.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN
    matched rent[2026-03] on 2026-03-05: model -100.00 PLN, observed -100.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN, timing +1 days
  cut 2026-06-20
a1 (m = 2026-04): residuals konto 2026-04
  cut 2026-06-20
a4 (q = 2026-01): residuals konto 2026-01
  2026-03 unexplained: model 0.00 PLN, observed -5.00 PLN, difference -5.00 PLN
    unexplained bank[r2] on 2026-03-20: observed -5.00 PLN
  2026-03 move rent: model -100.00 PLN, observed -100.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN
    matched rent[2026-03] on 2026-03-05: model -100.00 PLN, observed -100.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN, timing +1 days
  cut 2026-06-20
a5 (y = 2026): residuals konto 2026
  2026-03 unexplained: model 0.00 PLN, observed -5.00 PLN, difference -5.00 PLN
    unexplained bank[r2] on 2026-03-20: observed -5.00 PLN
  2026-03 move rent: model -100.00 PLN, observed -100.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN
    matched rent[2026-03] on 2026-03-05: model -100.00 PLN, observed -100.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN, timing +1 days
  cut 2026-06-20
a11: residuals konto 2026-03
  2026-03 unexplained: model 0.00 PLN, observed -5.00 PLN, difference -5.00 PLN
    unexplained bank[r2] on 2026-03-20: observed -5.00 PLN
  2026-03 move rent: model -100.00 PLN, observed -100.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN
    matched rent[2026-03] on 2026-03-05: model -100.00 PLN, observed -100.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN, timing +1 days
  cut 2026-06-20
warning: WARN-NEGATIVE konto is below zero from 2026-05-05
warning: WARN-UNREAD place unexplained is read by nothing
